# memory-cleanup 部署清单
# 源:  scripts/memory-cleanup/
# 标:  /root/.hermes/scripts/memory-cleanup/
# 影响: 记忆分类清理脚本（手动触发）；无需重启服务
#
# 语法: 每行一个 glob 模式（相对项目根）；以 ! 开头为排除；# 起始为注释。

# === Include ===
src/memory_cleanup/**/*.py
compat/**/*.py
config/**/*.yaml
pyproject.toml
run.sh
daily_dryrun.sh
memory-classify-v6.py

# === Exclude ===
!**/__pycache__/**
!**/*.pyc
!**/.pytest_cache/**
!**/*.egg-info/**
!**/tests/**
!**/test_*.py
